OL,3,GNEWSATroubles bill 'must be improved
OL,4,Afurther' says human rights report
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report by a Westminster committee on
OL,7,Fhuman rights has called for changes to
OL,8,Fthe government's Troubles legacy bill.
OL,10,FLabour's proposed law was introduced to
OL,11,FParliament last year following
OL,12,Fagreement on a framework with the Irish
OL,13,Fgovernment.
OL,15,FThe Joint Committee on Human Rights
OL,16,F(JCHR) said it was a "significant
OL,17,Fimprovement" on the previous
OL,18,FConservative government's legislation,
OL,19,Fbut there were "areas where it must be
OL,20,Fimproved further".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
