OL,3,GNEWSATroubles bill 'must be improved
OL,4,Afurther' says human rights report
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant said last month the government
OL,8,Fwould be tabling amendments but
OL,9,Finsisted the plans were "full steam
OL,10,Fahead".
